#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0508 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: A variable ending in TMF must have a label that ends with "Imputation Flag" (or "Imput. Flag") and contains "Time"
#note "Labels in the shapes of CDISC's own ADaMIG labels, on sponsor names: XTMF spells Imputation in full (as ATMF does), XHETMF / XPERSTMF abbreviate to "Imput." (as PHETMF / APERSTMF), and XRTETMF interleaves words between "Time" and the suffix (as TRTETMF) -> all accepted. The real ADaMIG names resolve to their own literal or template rows in the product and are never judged by a stem rule (PLAN-library-template-label-resolution T2 review L4), so the scenario uses sponsor names to stay on the stem leg."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#library variable-metadata ADLBC *TMF name=*TMF label="{Time Imputation Flag}"
#library variable-metadata ADLBC *STMF name=*STMF label="{Start Time Imputation Flag}"
#library variable-metadata ADLBC *ETMF name=*ETMF label="{End Time Imputation Flag}"
dataset ADLBC class=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col XTMF type=Char label="Analysis Time Imputation Flag"
col XHETMF type=Char label="Phase End Time Imput. Flag"
col XPERSTMF type=Char label="Period Start Time Imput. Flag"
col XRTETMF type=Char label="Time of Last Exposure Imput. Flag"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALB | x | x | x | x
---
